Route32_Text_CooltrainerM_1::
	.string "Have you gone to the POKéMON GYM?\p"
	.string "You can test your POKéMON and\n"
	.string "yourself there.\p"
	.string "It’s a rite of passage for all\n"
	.string "trainers!$"

Route32_Text_CooltrainerM_2::
	.string "You have some good POKéMON there.\p"
	.string "It must be from the training you\n"
	.string "gave them around VIOLET CITY.\p"
	.string "The training at the GYM must have\n"
	.string "been especially helpful.\p"
	.string "As a souvenir of VIOLET CITY, take\n"
	.string "this. It increases the power of\l"
	.string "grass-type moves.$"

Route32_Text_CooltrainerM_3::
	.string "Your experiences in VIOLET CITY\n"
	.string "should be useful for your journey.$"

Route32_Text_BaldingMan_1::
	.string "WROOOOAR!\p"
	.string "PEOPLE RUN WHEN I ROAR!\n"
	.string "BUT YOU CAME LOOKING!\p"
	.string "THAT PLEASES ME!\n"
	.string "NOW TAKE THIS!$"

Route32_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "WROOOAR!\n"
	.string "IT’S ROAR!\p"
	.string "EVEN POKéMON RUN FROM A GOOD\n"
	.string "ROAR!$"

Route32_Text_Rocker_1::
	.string "How would you like to have this\n"
	.string "tasty, nutritious SLOWPOKETAIL?\p"
	.string "For you right now, just  1,000,000!\n"
	.string "You’ll want this!$"

Route32_Text_Rocker_2::
	.string "You don’t want it?\n"
	.string "Then scram. Shoo!$"

Route32_Text_Rocker_3::
	.string "Tch! I thought kids these days\n"
	.string "were loaded...$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterAlbertIntro::
	.string "I haven’t seen you around here.\n"
	.string "So you think you are pretty tough?$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterAlbertDefeat::
	.string "You’re strong!$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterAlbert::
	.string "I’m going to try to be the best\n"
	.string "with my favorites.\p"
	.string "I’m not using the same tough POKéMON\n"
	.string "as everyone else.$"

Route32_Text_Picnicker153Intro::
	.string "Uh-huh. Yeah, and you know...\p"
	.string "Pardon? Battle? I’m on the phone.\p"
	.string "Oh, all right. But make it fast.$"

Route32_Text_Picnicker153Defeat::
	.string "Take it easy!\n"
	.string "That’s mean!$"

Route32_Text_Picnicker153::
	.string "I was having a nice chat too.$"

Route32_Text_CamperRolandIntro::
	.string "That glance...\n"
	.string "It’s intriguing.$"

Route32_Text_CamperRolandDefeat::
	.string "Hmmm. This is disappointing.$"

Route32_Text_CamperRoland::
	.string "If you don’t want to battle, just\n"
	.string "avoid eye contact.$"

Route32_Text_FishermanHenryIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON?\n"
	.string "Freshly caught!$"

Route32_Text_FishermanHenryDefeat::
	.string "SPLASH?$"

Route32_Text_FishermanHenry::
	.string "Freshly caught POKéMON are no\n"
	.string "match for properly raised ones.$"

Route32_Text_FishermanJustinIntro::
	.string "Whoa!\n"
	.string "You made me lose that fish!$"

Route32_Text_FishermanJustinDefeat::
	.string "Sploosh!$"

Route32_Text_FishermanJustin::
	.string "Calm, collected...\n"
	.string "The essence of fishing and POKéMON\l"
	.string "is the same.$"

Route32_Text_BirdKeeperPeterIntro::
	.string "That BADGE! It’s from VIOLET CITY!\n"
	.string "You beat FALKNER?$"

Route32_Text_BirdKeeperPeterDefeat::
	.string "I know what my weaknesses are.$"

Route32_Text_BirdKeeperPeter::
	.string "I should train again at the GYM\n"
	.string "in VIOLET CITY.$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterGordonIntro::
	.string "I found some good POKéMON in the\n"
	.string "grass!\p"
	.string "I think they’ll do it for me!$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterGordonDefeat::
	.string "Darn. I thought I could win.$"

Route32_Text_YoungsterGordon::
	.string "The grass is full of clingy things.$"

Route32_Text_Fisherman146Intro::
	.string "I’m a good angler, but an even better\n"
	.string "trainer!$"

Route32_Text_Fisherman146Defeat::
	.string "Tch! I tried to rush things...$"

Route32_Text_Fisherman146::
	.string "Fishing is a lifelong passion.\n"
	.string "POKéMON are lifelong friends!$"

Route32_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "Wait up!\n"
	.string "What’s the hurry?$"

Route32_Text_Sign1::
	.string "RUINS OF ALPH\n"
	.string "EAST ENTRANCE$"

Route32_Text_Sign2::
	.string "ROUTE 32\n"
	.string "VIOLET CITY - AZALEA TOWN$"

Route32_Text_Sign3::
	.string "UNION CAVE Ahead$"
